{"title":"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems\">2002 AMC 12P #20</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems\">2002 AMC 10P #21</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Note\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Note</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2(Similar_to_Sol_1)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2(Similar to Sol 1)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> be a real-valued function such that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/8/7b8f169d95ff4cb31a080981438fce1beff21c31.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x) + 2f(\\frac{2002}{x}) = 3x\\]\" width=\"175\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/b/acbc84e38fcf36b728033e68ab60cb4be6fee9d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/7/1c7e657ab500a4fadfaef86aef90265413c4bd6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/6/346cfc2686879b3ebbc008ed548556335edcb234.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }1000 \\qquad \\text{(B) }2000 \\qquad \\text{(C) }3000 \\qquad \\text{(D) }4000 \\qquad \\text{(E) }6000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"469\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/e/04e0c6f239bd8e4f9d4ed1f0b936746d21f7a189.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) + 2f(1001) = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"162\" height=\"20\" />.\nSetting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3333c3e6893be73529fb3a561d6c739dbb7e509.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f5c06febbd5bd116ae168b76962789abb3eccba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(2) + f(1001) = 3003$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Adding these 2 equations and dividing by 3 gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/4/9b4d64f9f631a62ed169ebe5e32530a15051408d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) + f(1001) = \\frac{6+3003}{3} = 1003$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"276\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Subtracting these 2 equations gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/9/649c6c518c306e692c75dce4d3e49d8423d9f2ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) - f(1001) = 2997$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"180\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/7/c670b9d06fbbe9f56f0c8fb6230ba739c66a30f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = \\frac{1003+2997}{2} = \\boxed {\\textbf{(B) }2000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"266\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Note\">Note</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Note\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We can find a closed form expression for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> using this method. We have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/8/7b8f169d95ff4cb31a080981438fce1beff21c31.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x) + 2f(\\frac{2002}{x}) = 3x\\]\" width=\"175\" height=\"37\" /> and plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b76d3bc9ce223b14ccf0eef71e43cbf797b75ada.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2002}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"38\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/5/fb54cff68434699017c43c2d740e3f782454ce1d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(\\frac{2002}{x}) + 2f(x) = 3(\\frac{2002}{x}).\\]\" width=\"223\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/8/d58db14b1f52be1175cab1a442a5e16b2777cde6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/8/d6816c638e73776ae644f043e6eb5169b0dc050b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = f(\\frac{2002}{x})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"99\" height=\"38\" />. Then, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/7/667e34038842d0e28451f368a507b271c446701b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a + 2b = 3x \\tag{1}\\]\" width=\"314\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/9/10914adc8d1d52f64acab211d24a7427ad99b702.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a + b = \\frac{6006}{x} \\tag{2}\\]\" width=\"324\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>We add equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> and divide by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/6/786f2e7fdfec5773397f311285fab0146b6a0420.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = x + \\frac{2002}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"139\" height=\"38\" />. Subtracting this from equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> gives us the closed form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/3/db3bb74497c19c277025ebd280c01be80d5a80ba.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x) = \\frac{4004}{x} - x\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Indeed, plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/f/79f88a6b549847c59c0659d428dc169f85e4e65c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = \\frac{4004}{2} - 2 = \\boxed {\\textbf{(B) }2000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"239\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2.28Similar_to_Sol_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2(Similar_to_Sol_1)\">Solution 2(Similar to Sol 1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2(Similar to Sol 1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> in the given equation yields\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/b/88b035fd2c1a9d4593729e68f7c9acef6f18dc4c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(2) + 2f(1001) = 6.\\]\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" />\nSetting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3333c3e6893be73529fb3a561d6c739dbb7e509.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" /> gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/2/cd292a0bc0231d41b0016b4f0e119affeaccbc5f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2f(2) + f(1001) = 3003.\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Adding these two equations and dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/5/215191f01de8eed11febdac10c5f2bf2b61d3aac.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(2) + f(1001) = \\frac{6 + 3003}{3} = 1003.\\]\" width=\"276\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>We now have the system:\n\\begin{align*}\nf(2) + f(1001) &amp;= 1003 \\\\\n2f(2) + f(1001) &amp;= 3003\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>Subtracting the first equation from the second gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/2/7c2bbe5ee1bdc652f193d58245b8b00e0cd8a6e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(2) = 3003 - 1003 = 2000.\\]\" width=\"216\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/8/0087198e35efdabfd7ca2091020f9e17cfe4880a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }2000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"143\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P\">2002 AMC 10P</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_13\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_21\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/P